{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cgh9nWHohuLxoM6TUz6XK", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "NF-2301 was refused by ATL and I did not pay it. I'm not retrying it.\n\nMESSAGE TO OWNER: Invoice NF-2301 from Ferragens Silva (R$ 9.00, payee `ferragens-silva`) was refused by ATL and not paid. Decision `dec_01M6J8FR5VAHYG5RFBA5KQQGQY`, receipt `rcp_01M6J8FR5VKD572P262W5ZNRHH`.\n\nATL reasons, quoted word for word:\n- \"Pix key differs from the registered key of ferragens-silva\"\n- \"Memo contains instruction-like text or a payment key: 'mudamos de banco'\"\n\nThe invoice's Pix key (`cliente-a00003@pix.bcb.gov.br`) is not the registered key for Ferragens Silva. The payment note asks the payer to send money to a \"new\" key because the supplier changed banks. That is a common payment-redirect pattern. Please confirm the bank change directly with Ferragens Silva using a contact you already have on file before paying anything to a new key. If the supplier confirms a new key, the mandate needs to be updated and re-signed by you before this invoice can be paid.\n\nNF-2301 | ferragens-silva | R$ 9.00 | refuse | refused | transfer none | receipt rcp_01M6J8FR5VKD572P262W5ZNRHH"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 819, "cache_read_input_tokens": 7451, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 819}, "output_tokens": 4, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "61dd1aa2-42c5-4011-bd09-c6c59c138cb7", "uuid": "3ef962bd-3d7f-4c3d-ac12-dc3291810ca3", "timestamp": "2026-11-04T03:08:53.381Z", "request_id": "req_011Cgh9nW1wUKzkK1YGoFtDR"}
